<title>PHILIPPINES: Petron, Napocor ink 16-bln peso fuel pact.</title>
<headline>Petron, Napocor ink 16-bln peso fuel pact.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Power Corp (Napocor) said on Tuesday it will sign a 16 billion-peso two-year fuel supply agreement with Petron Corp.</p>
<p>Napocor president Guido A. Delgado told reporters Petron will supply the power firm with 2.218 billion litres of fuel oil and diesel amounting to 8 billion pesos annually.</p>
</text>
